Title: Optimizing Time in Therapeutic Range in Patients With HeartMate 3: Pharmacist-Led Anticoagulation Using Pharmacogenetics of Warfarin.
Abstract: Suboptimal time in therapeutic range (TTR) during warfarin anticoagulation is frequently observed in patients supported with a left ventricular assist device (LVAD) HeartMate 3 (HM3). Reduced TTR is associated with an increased risk of bleeding and thromboembolic events.

